  "change": "PR #1964: authenticated capture provider budgets (Case46 governed artifact, server read-only captures, synthetic reads) are admitted ledger-only: priced reservations and settlements are still recorded against the declared qualification figures, but dispatch is never refused on attempts, tokens or cost. The hard-coded $3/$15 per-capture ceilings are removed; production research budgets stay enforced; the operator spend journal remains the approved-budget authority. PR #1965: exact generation-2 retained-history recovery binding for the second failed Case46 run (3a5b5609), preserving both failures and the generation-1 retirement record.",
